  "cause": {
    "proximate_text": "the Hi-Hi Thrust Bearing Position trip was caused by the Input/Output cards inside the Turbine Supervisory Instrumentation (TSI) providing a trip signal from a combination of the 'B' Main Turbine Thrust Probe Hi-Hi Position and a bad quality input from the 1X Main Turbine Vibration Probe. The system logic should have required a 2 out of 2 Hi-Hi Thrust Bearing Position condition to trip. However, the trip logic inappropriately factored in an input from a bad quality vibration probe.",
    "cause_code": "X",
    "category": "Other",
    "theme": "TSI trip-logic design flaw allowed bad-quality vibration input to satisfy 2-of-2 trip logic",
    "provisional": false
  },
